- op: discuss  # f935
  at: '2026-07-12T19:21:52Z'  # f935
  by: agent  # f935
  actor: jgstern_agent  # f935
  clock: 4  # f935
  nonce: f935  # f935
  message: "Fixed in PR #603 (selfh dev 5894a2f5b1). The websocket-linker's _PATTERN_TYPE_TO_FRAMEWORK was dep-blind: a Starlette app whose @app.websocket endpoints match the FastAPI pattern (FastAPI is built on Starlette, shared route syntax) was stamped server_framework/framework_dispatch=fastapi though fastapi is not a dependency (6 self-analysis edges, repo actually depends on starlette). Fix: extracted profile._collect_python_deps(repo_root) + added _resolve_ws_framework which corrects fastapi->starlette when fastapi is undeclared but starlette is declared (genuine-fastapi repos and no-dep-signal cases pass through unchanged); applied at all 4 attribution sites (server_framework/client_framework + 2 framework_dispatch). Live: fresh self-analysis flips the 6 fastapi WS edges to starlette. 6 tests (4 unit + 2 end-to-end); 100% coverage. Wave-5 P1 linker-FP fix."  # f935
